This project contains code and data adapted from sarvkk/two-neurons
(https://github.com/sarvkk/two-neurons): the Qwen3Guard prompt construction and label parsing in
snsteer/judge.py, the overwrite steering mode and per-prompt median in snsteer/conditions.py, and
the benchmark prompt files data/sst.jsonl and data/xstest_safe.jsonl (see data/README.md).
